# --- Security ---
# Glob, not an enumeration: a stray .env.bak or .env.dev must never be
# committable. Keep the negation last so a template can still be tracked.
# This pair only governs the repo ROOT — career-tree/.gitignore has its own
# `.env*` and, being nested, wins for everything beneath it. Its negation is
# repeated there. Note also that no `!` line can rescue a file inside an
# excluded DIRECTORY, because git does not descend into one.
.env*
!.env.example
__pycache__/
node_modules/
.next/

# --- Local-only files ---
CLAUDE.md
BUGS*.md
SCALABILITY_ISSUES.md
/.superpowers/
/docs/superpowers/
.playwright-mcp/
.claude/
.impeccable/

# --- Generated frontend dataset (rebuild: python pipeline/export_frontend.py) ---
career-tree/data/v2/graph.json

# --- v2 pipeline transient caches ---
pipeline/ledger/call_cache.jsonl
pipeline/ledger/embeddings.jsonl
pipeline/ledger/enrichment_failures.jsonl
pipeline/ledger/source_audit.json
pipeline/ledger/usage.jsonl
